                    Fib_{E_1}([\gamma]) \;\colon\; e \mapsto \hat \gamma(1)
            %p
              Since the function
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi f
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f
              is compatible with the covering projections, the image
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi f
                    %mo ∘
                    %mover
                      %mi γ
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ^
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f\circ \hat \gamma
              is a lift of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi γ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \gamma
              to
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi E
