            %p
              This is also called the
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Grothendieck+construction"} Grothendieck construction
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monodromy"} monodromy
              functor
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
